### LAB 5 — health + security headers
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health

### SQLi normal search/filter for own shifts
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/shifts?userName=Nadia&sortBy=date&order=desc
X-Demo-UserId: 1

### SQLi PoC after fix: payload is treated as a value, not SQL code
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/shifts?userName=Nadia'%20OR%201=1%20--&sortBy=date&order=desc
X-Demo-UserId: 1

### IDOR: no demo user context -> 401
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/shifts/1

### IDOR: own resource -> 200
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/shifts/1
X-Demo-UserId: 1

### IDOR: чужий ресурс, Olena намагається прочитати Nadia shift -> 404
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/shifts/1
X-Demo-UserId: 2

### IDOR: чужий update -> 404
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/shifts/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-UserId: 2

{
  "comment": "Trying to update someone else's shift"
}

### XSS: створення запису з HTML/JS-подібним текстом у comment
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/shifts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-UserId: 1

{
  "date": "2026-04-22",
  "timeSlot": "14:00-16:00",
  "userName": "Nadia",
  "comment": "<img src=x onerror=alert('xss')>",
  "status": "planned"
}

### Misconfiguration: validation error returns unified 400, not stack trace
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/shifts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-UserId: 1

{
  "date": "",
  "timeSlot": "bad-time-slot",
  "userName": "N",
  "status": "planned"
}
